      "node_id": "kg_doc_8",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Younger Now is the sixth studio album by American singer Miley Cyrus. It was released on September 29, 2017, by RCA Records. It is her first full-length project since \"Miley Cyrus & Her Dead Petz\" (2015), and her first commercially released project since \"Bangerz\" (2013). Cyrus began planning a commercial follow-up record to \"Bangerz\" while simultaneously making \"Miley Cyrus & Her Dead Petz\" in 2015, although later became influenced by her reconciliation with fiancé Liam Hemsworth in 2016. \"Younger Now\" was written and produced by Cyrus and Oren Yoel, with whom she had collaborated on her previous two full-lengths. Not concerning herself with radio airplay, their efforts resulted in an \"honest\" final product that sees Cyrus \"leaning into her roots.\" It features guest vocals from her godmother, country music singer Dolly Parton.",
